{
  "version": "jinsha-dialogue-v15",
  "provider": "HeyGen Voice",
  "format": "PCM16 mono, 44100 Hz",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "intro-n",
      "text": "这里是金沙的古河岸。看见河湾边那九个柱洞了吗？木头早就朽了，可那座房子原来朝着哪边，也许还能找出来。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/intro-n.wav",
      "startSample": 4366,
      "endSample": 377869,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 8.4695,
      "gainDb": -5.71,
      "sha256": "1cf9f1b198fbc5dab273643b7e835e951506f53043e8d18bdf7b5d5051d2d0ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-1",
      "text": "先看木桩下面。深色的泥里，露出一道浅浅的砂带。古河改过道，这就是它留下的一点痕迹。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/site-1.wav",
      "startSample": 388212,
      "endSample": 723452,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 7.6018,
      "gainDb": -5.41,
      "sha256": "755a4128150fee9fa7f2c6fcfede8cf92e29fcfca1bae66f05fd1200ebd9296c"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-2",
      "text": "看那截漂木。到芦苇边，它慢了下来，又轻轻打了个转。把竹排划过去，试试那里的水往哪儿走。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/site-2.wav",
      "startSample": 734221,
      "endSample": 1074599,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 7.7183,
      "gainDb": -5.04,
      "sha256": "716591ffdedf2ae5cfd953d2c23d934bfc24da8081684d1010dc71f54a5de2eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-3",
      "text": "漂木跟着水走，这副根盘却留在原地。顺着侧根看进去，木头的纹理里，还留着辨认树种的线索。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/site-3.wav",
      "startSample": 1077628,
      "endSample": 1444830,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 8.3266,
      "gainDb": -5.54,
      "sha256": "a906fdf37edb58596777613b3fd8c3eee33c470f47980b043325b91bb3e58203"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-4",
      "text": "一根软绳，怎么能切开这么硬的玉？你看锯缝里，还粘着湿砂。把绳拉起来，手上就能觉出差别了。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/site-4.wav",
      "startSample": 1449435,
      "endSample": 1835000,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 8.743,
      "gainDb": -5.1,
      "sha256": "4cee7ceeff9225b6207feedaed5d328c33ea493f49fc2387411fe51f4a71350f"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-5",
      "text": "这几块陶片，以前也许挨得很近。先用口规比一比弧度，再把断口对着光，慢慢转。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/site-5.wav",
      "startSample": 1840822,
      "endSample": 2142158,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 6.833,
      "gainDb": -4.99,
      "sha256": "7e86b413947e1096ddbbc8381db36716b12c4ee759ce3060ea95abef7950372a"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-6",
      "text": "铜鸟的尾巴比看上去薄。先别松手，把陶托移到鸟身底下，再慢慢放。看看重量最后落在哪里。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/site-6.wav",
      "startSample": 2142177,
      "endSample": 2490240,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 7.8926,
      "gainDb": -5.82,
      "sha256": "342ecc00eeec7d60f3c1cbcd4e9ca3ed817ea4fd77cd424f24e1bc8535fe26a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-7",
      "text": "这一根象牙压着另一根。等它们被抬起来，谁在上、谁在下，就再也看不见了。趁现在，把它们一起拍下来。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/site-7.wav",
      "startSample": 2490240,
      "endSample": 2884124,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 8.9316,
      "gainDb": -5.32,
      "sha256": "39498ef02a35206c29d1ea214037ab997554b8d9521eba1372f19a9ac6d36995"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-8",
      "text": "把灯慢慢移到金箔背后。刚才还晃眼的金面暗下去了，光却从镂空的地方透出来。四只鸟，就在那儿。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/site-8.wav",
      "startSample": 2884124,
      "endSample": 3252290,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 8.3484,
      "gainDb": -6.05,
      "sha256": "3314ce3c2f7a0431d3fa012d674c893d8e77e3be5a9585613bf209eddf572f8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-9",
      "text": "还记得河湾边那九个洞吗？现在，测绳在你手里了。从一个洞心拉到另一个，量出这座建筑曾经的方向。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/site-9.wav",
      "startSample": 3252290,
      "endSample": 3629224,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 8.5473,
      "gainDb": -6.56,
      "sha256": "e7c55cc2b3cb5ad9520e4e3cde7fc56745f2018fbbdbed165bea9e93be8fd687"
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-n",
      "text": "太阳出来了。你看，光正掠过刚才量过的柱洞。三千年前，也有人站在这片河岸上，等着天亮。",
      "role": "narrator",
      "voice": "Shuxian",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/finale-n.wav",
      "startSample": 3632296,
      "endSample": 3991888,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 8.154,
      "gainDb": -5.41,
      "sha256": "a5f5213a68145a4c17f92a72847beccf5ad366557ab083ea2fe124acc8c35daf"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-s",
      "text": "我叫烁羽。来，跟我落到木桩旁边。瞧，土里那道白砂，是不是像一条小河？",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/intro-s.wav",
      "startSample": 2470,
      "endSample": 279108,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 6.273,
      "gainDb": -2.08,
      "sha256": "bc6802fb9ef70e9792a8f7d0a27e562cc022e28c1ebfbb40e01941d6255a2d42"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel-1",
      "text": "木桩后头有点不一样。咱们飞低一点，贴着土壁看看。",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/travel-1.wav",
      "startSample": 290354,
      "endSample": 448889,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 3.5949,
      "gainDb": -2.57,
      "sha256": "38857f1757b6b56ad7536d31d19411666b1873c72b3f78194d11cc9f2ea869b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel-2",
      "text": "从上面看得真清楚！那道砂带一直弯向河心。走，我们去芦湾解竹排。",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/travel-2.wav",
      "startSample": 448889,
      "endSample": 700260,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 5.7,
      "gainDb": -1.8,
      "sha256": "10ebfd542141d063c0e2700a203a1a98fbde9fcde155b9eef25b18993dff71d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel-3",
      "text": "你看，东岸坡上那团黑影，像不像树根？我先飞过去，等你一起看。",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/travel-3.wav",
      "startSample": 700260,
      "endSample": 906941,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 4.6866,
      "gainDb": -2.62,
      "sha256": "0ea757617b6c449641d60e3d0de8afdac64d8cb1a07af0552a7f8f7e640bfdbd"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel-4",
      "text": "等等，斜棚里那块玉上有条细缝。是谁切到一半，把绳子搁下了？",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/travel-4.wav",
      "startSample": 906941,
      "endSample": 1148387,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 5.475,
      "gainDb": -1.74,
      "sha256": "ba04abdd6792e8602dab8cf26daebdf115bb5233795e9799b9e857a06e647239"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel-5",
      "text": "这个口规先带着。你看，前面席子上那些陶片，好像少了半边。",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/travel-5.wav",
      "startSample": 1152994,
      "endSample": 1361545,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 4.729,
      "gainDb": -1.48,
      "sha256": "4db7381ec5e3033880c38096aae9c8a8581b9b75938aa0e8974b3a98818c9074"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel-6",
      "text": "我可不敢落在那只铜鸟尾巴上，太薄啦。把刚修好的陶托也带过来吧。",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/travel-6.wav",
      "startSample": 1361545,
      "endSample": 1597987,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 5.3615,
      "gainDb": -2.68,
      "sha256": "fa2ab7ab4c1ac83ed7925864c26c72c2725c86e5ccfd0097b9a19b2272f215e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel-7",
      "text": "西岸棚子底下露出了一截象牙。先拍照，好不好？我想记住它原来躺在哪儿。",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/travel-7.wav",
      "startSample": 1597987,
      "endSample": 1856257,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 5.8565,
      "gainDb": -1.35,
      "sha256": "04096b53d82c5933a6cc47b01884eaa2fd72bd1c25ee02f716e534c6e848ed96"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel-8",
      "text": "那边有一盏灯！我想知道，把光挪到金箔后面，还能不能看见那四只鸟。",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/travel-8.wav",
      "startSample": 1857481,
      "endSample": 2105219,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 5.6176,
      "gainDb": -1.89,
      "sha256": "089131e94c29f0399ff78c46aaeaaefe7cb798123bee1977b11115d8e6ea13ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel-9",
      "text": "终于到高台了。把测绳递给我一头，咱们看看，这几排柱洞究竟朝哪边。",
      "role": "spirit",
      "voice": "Haoran",
      "src": "/assets/v15/voices/travel-9.wav",
      "startSample": 2105219,
      "endSample": 2374741,
      "rate": 44100,
      "seconds": 6.1116,
      "gainDb": -1.8,
      "sha256": "a597ec5fb7fb716fc3bf2571401f338c664a9e43856e8becf1f0c88d93fceb51"
    }
  ]
}
